{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 7 then min(v_1) ≥ -10 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 10 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, shape(v_1, 0) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) < 10 ∧ shape(v_1, i) > -10
