Rule 107 (Check if tensor is a 3D tensor with each dimension's size less than 100 and greater than 0, shape[0] < shape[1] < shape[2] AND shape[0] + shape[1] + shape[2] < 200)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 2] : shape(v_1, i) < 100 ∧ shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) < shape(v_1, 1) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) < shape(v_1, 2) ∧ shape(v_1, 0) + shape(v_1, 1) + shape(v_1, 2) < 200
>>
Rule 108 (If name is equal to "swish", "constant", or "linear" tensor's max must be < 100 AND min must be greater than 0)
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= (v_1 = "swish" ∨ v_1 = "constant" ∨ v_1 = "linear") ∧ max(v_2) < 100 ∧ min(v_2) > 0
