Rule 109 (If the name contains a number, dtype_ of tensor should be equal to the number, shape(v1,0) should be greater than this number, ndim of v1 == 2 AND all of shape(v1) must be positive )
{v_1 : str, v_2 : tensor} |= ∃i ∈ [0, v_1.len - 1] : (v_1[i] ≥ "0" ∧ v_1[i] ≤ "9") ∧ dtype_(v_2) = (v_1[i] - "0") ∧ shape(v_2, 0) > (v_1[i] - "0") ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ ∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) -1]: shape(v_2, j) > 0
>>
Rule 110 (If tensor is complex128, then max should be greater than 0 and less than 1000, min should be greater than -1000, shape should be greated than zero, min < 100 AND max - min < 500)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 10 then max(v_1) > 0 ∧ max(v_1) < 1000 ∧ min(v_1) > -1000 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ min(v_1) < 100 ∧ (max(v_1) - min(v_1)) < 500
